--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whatsnew/fragments/7229.bugfix
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fix a crash when a ``regexp_csv`` or ``regexp_paths_csv`` option (e.g. ``bad-names-rgxs``
+or ``ignore-paths``) contains a regular expression with a comma in a quantifier such as
+``(foo{1,3})``.
+
+Closes #7229
